  "description": "FAXCEP crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C208 H154 O42 Tb9 1+,1.7(C2 H6 O1),N1 O3 1-. From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb5 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb6 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb7 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb8 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb9 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 20 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.581-5.112 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 88.75-170.13°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Tb9(OH)10(hbzp)16](NO3)·1.7EtOH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 10 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
